        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Reer Cammoon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, wejigaaga reer Cammoon u sii jeedi oo iyaga wax ka sii sheeg, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaad reer Cammoon ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ah eraygiisa maqla, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaad Ahaa ku tidhaahdeen meeshayda quduuska ah markii la nijaaseeyey, iyo markuu dalka reer binu Israa'iil cidlada noqday, iyo markay dadka Yahuudah maxaabiisnimo u bexeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed bal ogow, hanti ahaan ayaan dadka bari kuu siin doonaa, oo iyana xerooyinkooda bay kaa dhex samaysan doonaan, oo hooygoodana dhexdaaday ka samaysan doonaan. Midhahaaga way cuni doonaan, caanahaagana way dhami doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbaahna waxaan ka dhigi doonaa gole geel, meesha reer Cammoonna waxaan ka dhigi doonaa xeryo adhi, oo markaasaad ogaan doontaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waad sacbisay, waanad rablaysay, oo qalbigaagaad ku rayraysay adigoo aad iyo aad dalka reer binu Israa'iil u quudhsanaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo sidaas daraaddeed bal ogow, gacantaydaan kugu soo dul fidiyey, oo quruumaha ayaan booli ahaan kuu siin doonaa, oo dadyowga dhexdooda waan kaa gooyn doonaa, oo waxaan kaa dhigi doonaa inaad waddammada oo dhan ka halligantid, waanan ku wada baabbi'in doonaa, oo waxaad ogaan doontaa inaan Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Moo'aab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Moo'aab iyo Seciir waxay leeyihiin, Dadka dalka Yahuudah quruumaha oo dhan bay la mid yihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed bal ogaada, anigu dalka Moo'aab dhinac baan ka faruuri doonaa xagga magaalooyinkiisa, waana magaalooyinka soohdintiisa ku yaal, kuwaas oo ah dalka ammaantiisa, oo ah Beytyeshimood, iyo Bacal Mecoon, iyo Qiryatayim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaan u sii dayn doonaa dadka reer bari inay reer Cammoon ku kacaan, oo hanti ahaan baan iyaga u siin doonaa si aan reer Cammoon mar dambe quruumaha dhexdooda loogu soo xusuusan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo anigu xukun baan reer Moo'aab ku soo dejin doonaa, oo markaasay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Reer Edom",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Reer Edom aarsasho buu dadka Yahuudah kula macaamilooday, oo si weyn ayuu u xumeeyey, oo iyaga wuu ka aar goostay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Gacantaydaan dalka Edom ku dul fidin doonaa, oo dad iyo duunyoba waan ka baabbi'in doonaa, oo cidla baan ka dhigi doonaa tan iyo Teman, oo tan iyo Dedan seef baa lagu le'an doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan aarsashadayda dul saari doonaa reer Edom, oo gacanta dadkayga reer binu Israa'iil ayaan kaga aarsan doonaa, iyaguna reer Edom way ku samayn doonaan sida ay cadhadaydu tahay iyo sida uu xanaaqaygu yahay, oo waxay ogaan doonaan aarsashadayda, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Reer Falastiin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Reer Falastiin aarsashay kula macaamiloodeen oo iyagoo qalbiga ka quudhsanaya ayay ka aarsadeen si ay cadownimo weligeed ah ugu baabbi'iyaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eeg, gacantaydaan reer Falastiin ku dul fidin doonaa, oo reer Kereetiimna waan gooyn doonaa, oo kuwa badda xeebteeda ku hadhayna waan baabbi'in doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan dushooda ku soo dejin doonaa aarsasho weyn anigoo xanaaq weyn ku canaananaya, oo markaan aarsashadayda dul saaro waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
